'''Novara Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Novara}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: NOV, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: NOIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Novara]], the third-largest city in [[Balboa]] and the capital of [[Nurra Province]]. The airport is located on the [[Aethiopian Ocean]] coast and serves the northern commercial and industrial region of the country. Novara is one of the busiest domestic airports in Balboa, reflecting the city's status as a major economic centre. The airport is jet-capable and handles both [[Aeroístmus]] and [[RapidAir (Balboa)|RapidAir]] services.

